    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Topology Notes",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**HP ProCurve 2510G-24**\n\n- Port 24 is the configured **mirror destination**. Its traffic totals should not be interpreted as normal endpoint utilisation.\n- Port 23 is the `docker-01` uplink and had historical TX discards; this dashboard tracks the *rate/increase*, not merely the cumulative counter.\n- Ports 15, 17 and 19 are ASUS router/AP nodes and may legitimately learn several downstream client MAC addresses.\n- MAC-to-port detail remains outside Prometheus to avoid high-cardinality metrics."
      }
    }
